msgid "Please enter a correct %(username)s and password. Note that both fields may be case-sensitive."
msgstr "To‘g‘ri %(username)s va parolni kiriting. Ikkala maydon katta-kichik harflarga sezgir bo‘lishi mumkin."

msgid "Raw passwords are not stored, so there is no way to see the user’s password."
msgstr "Parollar ochiq holda saqlanmaydi, shuning uchun foydalanuvchi parolini ko‘rish imkoni yo‘q."

msgid "Required. 150 characters or fewer. Letters, digits and @/./+/-/_ only."
msgstr "Majburiy. 150 belgidan oshmasin. Faqat harflar, raqamlar va @/./+/-/_ belgilari."

msgid "Reset password"
msgstr "Parolni tiklash"

msgid "Set password: %s"
msgstr "Parol o‘rnatish: %s"

msgid "Specific permissions for this user."
msgstr "Bu foydalanuvchi uchun alohida ruxsatlar."

msgid "The groups this user belongs to. A user will get all permissions granted to each of their groups."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi a’zo bo‘lgan guruhlar. Foydalanuvchi har bir guruhga berilgan barcha ruxsatlarni oladi."

msgid "The password is too similar to the %(verbose_name)s."
msgstr "Parol %(verbose_name)s ga juda o‘xshash."

msgid "The two password fields didn’t match."
msgstr "Ikki parol maydoni mos kelmadi."

msgid "This account is inactive."
msgstr "Bu akkaunt faol emas."

msgid "This password is entirely numeric."
msgstr "Parol faqat raqamlardan iborat."

msgid "This password is too common."
msgstr "Bu parol juda keng tarqalgan."

msgid "This password is too short. It must contain at least %d character."
msgstr "Parol juda qisqa. Kamida %d belgidan iborat bo‘lishi kerak."

msgid "Whether the user will be able to authenticate using a password or not. If disabled, they may still be able to authenticate using other backends, such as Single Sign-On or LDAP."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi parol bilan kira oladimi. O‘chirilgan bo‘lsa ham boshqa usullar (masalan, Single Sign-On yoki LDAP) bilan kirishi mumkin."

msgid "Your old password was entered incorrectly. Please enter it again."
msgstr "Joriy parol noto‘g‘ri kiritildi. Qayta kiriting."

msgid "Your password can’t be a commonly used password."
msgstr "Parol keng tarqalgan bo‘lishi mumkin emas."

msgid "Your password can’t be entirely numeric."
msgstr "Parol faqat raqamlardan iborat bo‘lishi mumkin emas."

msgid "Your password can’t be too similar to your other personal information."
msgstr "Parol shaxsiy ma’lumotlaringizga juda o‘xshash bo‘lishi mumkin emas."

msgid "Your password must contain at least %(min_length)d character."
msgstr "Parol kamida %(min_length)d belgidan iborat bo‘lishi kerak."

